{"id":"sage-eye-stronghold-2","name":"Sage Eye Stronghold","type":"location","aliases":["Sage Eye"],"description":"Jeskai stronghold.","pages":2,"first_seen":"2014-10-22","last_seen":"2014-10-22","description_citations":[{"source":"mtg-wiki","official":false,"publisher":"MTG Wiki contributors","work":"Shintan","series":"MTG Wiki","authors":[],"date":"","url":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Shintan","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Shintan","archived":null,"license":"CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, MTG Wiki contributors","text":"\"Shintan\". MTG Wiki contributors, CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, MTG Wiki contributors."}],"bio":null,"timeline":[{"id":"enlightened-e0","summary":"Narset meditates among a hundred monks in the plaza, outwardly serene while her mind races.","participants":["narset","jeskai"],"location":"sage-eye-stronghold-2","importance":"minor","page":"stories/enlightened","order":211,"story_date":"2014-10-22","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":2,"quote":"But just because I look quiet and serene doesn't mean I am.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/enlightened#:~:text=But%20just%20because%20I,doesn%27t%20mean%20I%20am.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Enlightened","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Matt Knicl"],"date":"2014-10-22","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/enlightened","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/enlightened#:~:text=But%20just%20because%20I,doesn%27t%20mean%20I%20am.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Enlightened\" by Matt Knicl. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 22 Oct 2014."}},{"id":"enlightened-e2","summary":"Narset secretly sticks her tongue out at a bored child during meditation.","participants":["narset"],"location":"sage-eye-stronghold-2","importance":"minor","page":"stories/enlightened","order":211,"story_date":"2014-10-22","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":6,"quote":"I stuck my tongue out quickly and he covered his mouth with both hands, apparently trying to stifle a gasp.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/enlightened#:~:text=I%20stuck%20my%20tongue,to%20stifle%20a%20gasp.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Enlightened","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Matt Knicl"],"date":"2014-10-22","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/enlightened","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/enlightened#:~:text=I%20stuck%20my%20tongue,to%20stifle%20a%20gasp.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Enlightened\" by Matt Knicl. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 22 Oct 2014."}},{"id":"enlightened-e3","summary":"Narset ends the session by reciting a traditional saying that she privately dislikes.","participants":["narset","jeskai"],"location":"sage-eye-stronghold-2","importance":"minor","page":"stories/enlightened","order":211,"story_date":"2014-10-22","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":8,"quote":"Our own selves are the greatest obstacles to enlightenment,","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/enlightened#:~:text=Our%20own%20selves%20are,greatest%20obstacles%20to%20enlightenment%2C","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Enlightened","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Matt Knicl"],"date":"2014-10-22","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/enlightened","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/enlightened#:~:text=Our%20own%20selves%20are,greatest%20obstacles%20to%20enlightenment%2C","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Enlightened\" by Matt Knicl. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 22 Oct 2014."}},{"id":"enlightened-e4","summary":"Narset slips away from her required solitary meditation, leaving a decoy with a melon for a head to fool her guard Shintan.","participants":["narset","shintan"],"location":"sage-eye-stronghold-2","importance":"minor","page":"stories/enlightened","order":211,"story_date":"2014-10-22","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":11,"quote":"I quickly constructed my decoy, dressed in the same clothes, complete with a melon for a head I had stored here the night before.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/enlightened#:~:text=I%20quickly%20constructed%20my,here%20the%20night%20before.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Enlightened","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Matt Knicl"],"date":"2014-10-22","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/enlightened","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/enlightened#:~:text=I%20quickly%20constructed%20my,here%20the%20night%20before.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Enlightened\" by Matt Knicl. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 22 Oct 2014."}},{"id":"enlightened-e5","summary":"Narset reads the Annals in the stronghold's depths, learning of clans working together against the dragons and of Ugin and Bolas, but cannot decipher Ugin's runes.","participants":["narset","annals-of-the-sage-eye","ugin","nicol-bolas"],"location":"sage-eye-stronghold-2","importance":"major","page":"stories/enlightened","order":211,"story_date":"2014-10-22","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":13,"quote":"I learned that a dragon named Ugin was connected to Tarkir in ways the khans couldn't comprehend, and that some had claimed Ugin was gone, but not dead.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/enlightened#:~:text=I%20learned%20that%20a,gone%2C%20but%20not%20dead.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Enlightened","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Matt Knicl"],"date":"2014-10-22","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/enlightened","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/enlightened#:~:text=I%20learned%20that%20a,gone%2C%20but%20not%20dead.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Enlightened\" by Matt Knicl. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 22 Oct 2014."}},{"id":"enlightened-e6","summary":"Returning to the pavilion, Narset finds eight Disowned orcs holding Shintan and her decoy destroyed.","participants":["narset","shintan","disowned"],"location":"sage-eye-stronghold-2","importance":"major","page":"stories/enlightened","order":211,"story_date":"2014-10-22","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":14,"quote":"I made it to the rock face and climbed back up to the pavilion to find eight Abzan orcs standing within.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/enlightened#:~:text=I%20made%20it%20to,Abzan%20orcs%20standing%20within.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Enlightened","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Matt Knicl"],"date":"2014-10-22","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/enlightened","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/enlightened#:~:text=I%20made%20it%20to,Abzan%20orcs%20standing%20within.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Enlightened\" by Matt Knicl. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 22 Oct 2014."}},{"id":"enlightened-e7","summary":"Narset ambushes the orcs, killing one with a palm strike to the heart, kicking two, and turning their commander against his own soldiers.","participants":["narset","disowned"],"location":"sage-eye-stronghold-2","importance":"major","page":"stories/enlightened","order":211,"story_date":"2014-10-22","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":17,"quote":"I landed in front of the orc and spun around, striking left of the center of the orc's chest, having timed his heart's pumping to stop it with my palm.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/enlightened#:~:text=I%20landed%20in%20front,it%20with%20my%20palm.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Enlightened","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Matt Knicl"],"date":"2014-10-22","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/enlightened","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/enlightened#:~:text=I%20landed%20in%20front,it%20with%20my%20palm.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Enlightened\" by Matt Knicl. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 22 Oct 2014."}},{"id":"enlightened-e8","summary":"Shintan frees himself and defeats his captors, and the two end the fight with orcs dead and wounded on the marble floor.","participants":["shintan","narset","disowned"],"location":"sage-eye-stronghold-2","importance":"minor","page":"stories/enlightened","order":211,"story_date":"2014-10-22","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":20,"quote":"The orcs lay, some dead, all bleeding, on the marble floor of the sacred temple.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/enlightened#:~:text=The%20orcs%20lay%2C%20some,of%20the%20sacred%20temple.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Enlightened","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Matt Knicl"],"date":"2014-10-22","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/enlightened","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/enlightened#:~:text=The%20orcs%20lay%2C%20some,of%20the%20sacred%20temple.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Enlightened\" by Matt Knicl. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 22 Oct 2014."}},{"id":"enlightened-e9","summary":"Shintan reports that an orc said Taigam hired them in revenge for an assassination attempt Narset allegedly sent; Narset denies knowing of any assassins.","participants":["shintan","narset","taigam"],"location":"sage-eye-stronghold-2","importance":"major","page":"stories/enlightened","order":211,"story_date":"2014-10-22","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":21,"quote":"He said he and his kin were hired by the rat Taigam.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/enlightened#:~:text=He%20said%20he%20and,by%20the%20rat%20Taigam.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Enlightened","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Matt Knicl"],"date":"2014-10-22","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/enlightened","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/enlightened#:~:text=He%20said%20he%20and,by%20the%20rat%20Taigam.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Enlightened\" by Matt Knicl. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 22 Oct 2014."}},{"id":"shintan-e0","summary":"Narset sneaks away from her meditation, leaving a decoy for Shintan to watch.","participants":["narset","shintan"],"location":"sage-eye-stronghold-2","importance":"minor","page":"wiki/shintan","order":1489,"story_date":"","storyline":"","source":"mtg-wiki","paragraph":2,"quote":"She quickly constructed a decoy, dressed in the same clothes","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Shintan#:~:text=She%20quickly%20constructed%20a,in%20the%20same%20clothes","citation":{"source":"mtg-wiki","official":false,"publisher":"MTG Wiki contributors","work":"Shintan","series":"MTG Wiki","authors":[],"date":"","url":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Shintan","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Shintan#:~:text=She%20quickly%20constructed%20a,in%20the%20same%20clothes","archived":null,"license":"CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, MTG Wiki contributors","text":"\"Shintan\", section \"History\". MTG Wiki contributors, CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, MTG Wiki contributors."}},{"id":"shintan-e1","summary":"Eight orcs ambush the plaza and hold Shintan; Narset finds her decoy destroyed.","participants":["shintan","narset"],"location":"sage-eye-stronghold-2","importance":"minor","page":"wiki/shintan","order":1489,"story_date":"","storyline":"","source":"mtg-wiki","paragraph":3,"quote":"she found eight formerly Abzan orcs standing within, holding Shintan","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Shintan#:~:text=she%20found%20eight%20formerly,standing%20within%2C%20holding%20Shintan","citation":{"source":"mtg-wiki","official":false,"publisher":"MTG Wiki contributors","work":"Shintan","series":"MTG Wiki","autho